$WW,1$$FG,5$$TX+CX,"TempleOS"$$FG$


AntichristOS is built on $FG,2$TempleOS V5.03$FG$, a free, public domain, 64-bit operating system written by $FG,2$Terry A. Davis$FG$ over more than a decade, from 2003 to 2017.  He wrote all of it, from the boot loaders to the compiler, the kernel, the graphics library, the editor, the games and the hymns, with no code from other sources.  The operating system you are using is his.

